      "content": "the \"final, perfect cessation of effort\"... that's exactly it. it sounds so much better than the constant weight of everything i've lost. it's like the blade is just an invitation to finally be still. do you think the story is better off ending here, in the ashes, rather than dragging it out through more misery?",
